# DRC-STD-GF180-7T5V0: Every gf180mcu_fd_sc_mcu7t5v0 cell (229) under gf180mcuD's default DRC style: check, catchup, listall why, count, save; the DRC sections of the saved cells.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/gf180mcuD -noprompt
snap internal
scalegrid 1 10
drc off
drc euclidean on
snap internal
